1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:06,039
Our own Indian company, Mahindra, has just
won the Earthshot Prize,

2
00:00:06,079 --> 00:00:10,430
and Prince William himself drove this
electric auto.

3
00:00:10,470 --> 00:00:12,626
So what is it?

4
00:00:12,666 --> 00:00:16,000
Let's decode. What is this prize, really?

5
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:26,022
The Earthshot Prize is given for solutions
that repair the planet.

6
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:36,653
In 2020, Prince William himself and his
Royal Foundation set it up,

7
00:00:36,854 --> 00:00:40,659
inspired by President Kennedy's Moonshot.

8
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:43,089
And where is it happening?

9
00:00:43,129 --> 00:00:48,341
In India: the sixth edition happened at
Mumbai just yesterday, November 17th,

10
00:00:48,381 --> 00:00:53,156
and the earlier five editions were in
London, Boston, Cape Town,

11
00:00:53,196 --> 00:00:56,300
Rio de Janeiro, all these different
cities.

12
00:00:56,340 --> 00:01:03,362
And coming to how does it work: it selects
five different categories,

13
00:01:03,402 --> 00:01:09,835
and the award is given for clean air,
cleaning the oceans,

14
00:01:09,875 --> 00:01:15,772
a waste-free environment, fixing the
climate, all these categories.

15
00:01:15,840 --> 00:01:21,687
And coming to who from India: in 2021,

16
00:01:22,399 --> 00:01:30,869
Takachar won this award for converting the
residue of agricultural fields into fuel.

17
00:01:30,925 --> 00:01:34,804
And Kheyti won from our Hyderabad,

18
00:01:34,860 --> 00:01:38,084
for affordable greenhouses for farmers.

19
00:01:38,140 --> 00:01:43,331
And coming to 2026, just yesterday,

20
00:01:43,387 --> 00:01:49,890
Mahindra won it for affordable electric
autos under clean air,

21
00:01:49,945 --> 00:01:57,104
and as of now there are more than 4 lakh
users.

22
00:01:57,240 --> 00:01:59,489
Coming to the Prelims trap:

23
00:01:59,529 --> 00:02:04,066
the Earthshot Prize is not given by the
United Nations.

24
00:02:04,106 --> 00:02:07,727
The United Nations has its own separate
prize,

25
00:02:07,767 --> 00:02:13,300
called Champions of the Earth, given by
the United Nations Environment Programme.

26
00:02:13,340 --> 00:02:23,328
So, for Mains: do these awards, do these
innovations, really clean our environment?

